Subject: perf(d3d12): optional 2x host MSAA for guest 4x surfaces in the native executor

native_executor_max_msaa_samples (default 0 = as the guest) limits the host samples of guest MSAA surfaces: 1 renders them single-sampled (as native_executor_single_sample_msaa), 2 stores guest 4x surfaces as host 2x. Host sample mode 4 maps each guest 4x sample to the nearer of the standard 2x positions; the layout's host sample mode field grows to bits 27:29. The precompiled native transfer, words and resolve shaders are rebuilt with fxc from the current sources (the 12 depth-destination ones only reflow their control flow), and the runtime-compiled resolve and stencil-reference sources get the same change.
